covered when it is a byte-offset bounded by and-0xff. The function body stops at the indirect branch. Upstream issue https://github.com/NationalSecurityAgency/ghidra/issues/10154 is open and names a Swift -O swift-enum switch; it has no fix commit and no milestone. REA reproduced the unrecovered jump table on the exact 12.2 build with an AArch64 ELF object of that instruction shape. A compare-bounded byte table still recovers. This record stays on every admitted build until a release is known to clear it."],"locations":[],"normalized_result":{"document":"target-9631ae440271.so","image_base":"0x100000","procedure_count":51,"segment_count":26,"segments":[{"address_space":"ram","end":"0x100238","image_base":"0x100000","length":568,"name":"segment_1.1","start":"0x100000"},{"address_space":"ram","end":"0x1002d0","image_base":"0x100000","length":152,"name":".note.android.ident","start":"0x100238"},{"address_space":"ram","end":"0x1003f0","image_base":"0x100000","length":288,"name":".dynsym","start":"0x1002d0"},{"address_space":"ram","end":"0x100408","image_base":"0x100000","length":24,"name":".gnu.version","start":"0x1003f0"},{"address_space":"ram","end":"0x100428","image_base":"0x100000","length":32,"name":".gnu.version_r","start":"0x100408"},{"address_space":"ram","end":"0x100448","image_base":"0x100000","length":32,"name":".gnu.hash","start":"0x100428"},{"address_space":"ram","end":"0x1004fb","image_base":"0x100000","length":179,"name":".dynstr","start":"0x100448"},{"address_space":"ram","end":"0x100b90","image_base":"0x100000","length":1680,"name":".rela.dyn","start":"0x100500"},{"address_space":"ram","end":"0x100c68","image_base":"0x100000","length":216,"name":".rela.plt","start":"0x100b90"},{"address_space":"ram","end":"0x101083","image_base":"0x100000","length":1043,"name":".rodata","start":"0x100c70"},{"address_space":"ram","end":"0x101148","image_base":"0x100000","length":196,"name":".eh_frame_hdr","start":"0x101084"},{"address_space":"ram","end":"0x10155c","image